# Duration sums beyond 64-bit machine integers

Java cannot represent these components (its duration components are `int`).

> Module Overflow64

```catala-metadata
#[test]
declaration scope Sum64:
  output d content duration
```

```catala
# An error in OCaml (first sum) and C (second sum)
scope Sum64:
  definition d equals
    let x equals 4611686018427387903 day in x + x + x
```
